  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Mana sphere, forbidden lore class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may create a tainted manabond as a manabond. When an ally that you have a tainted manabond with uses a sphere ability, you may allow them to benefit from your forbidden lore class feature as a free action even if it is not your turn. A creature may refuse this benefit if they so wish. If backlash occurs, it affects only you, but the ability still fails if triggering backlash would cause it to fail. A sphere ability can only benefit from forbidden lore once.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mana#toc116\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
